    },
    {
      "text": "ABOUT ME",
      "html": "<h2 class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\">ABOUT ME</h2>"
    },
    {
      "text": "(0,1,255)",
      "html": "<p class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\"><span class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">(0,1,255)</span></p>"
    },
    {
      "text": "Štefan Šraga",
      "html": "<h2 class=\"font_9 wixui-rich-text__text\">Štefan Šraga</h2>"
    },
    {
      "text": "I’ve always wanted to chase my dreams and keep improving myself. I am 33 years old and have extensive experience in marketing, retail, and the gaming industry. I’ve always cared about making sure my work gets noticed. Thanks to my efforts, I had the chance to visit E3 in Los Angeles twice. I was the second person in the country to successfully connect an esports organization with a first-league sports club. I believe my story proves that when you work hard, success will follow. From games, retail, marketing, and design to gaming and esports. you can read my full story on my LinkedIn profile. You can call me Štefan I love gaming and design I’m inspired by competition and creativity Dreams come true",
      "html": "<h4 class=\"font_4 wixui-rich-text__text\">I’ve always wanted to <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">chase my dreams</span></span> and <span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">keep improving myself</span></span>. I am 33 years old and have extensive experience in marketing, retail, and the gaming industry. I’ve always cared about making sure my <span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">work gets noticed</span></span>. <span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Thanks to my efforts</span></span>, I had the chance to visit E3 in Los Angeles twice.<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nI was the second person in the country to successfully <span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">connect</span></span> an <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">esports organization</span></span> with a <span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">first-league sports club</span></span>.<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nI believe my story proves that when you <span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">work hard</span></span>, <span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">success will follow</span></span>. From games, retail, marketing, and design to gaming and esports.<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nyou can read my full story on my <span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">LinkedIn profile</span></span>.<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nYou can call me <span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">Štefan</span></span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nI love gaming and design<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\nI’m inspired by <span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\"><span style=\"font-weight:bold;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">competition and creativity</span></span><br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<br class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">\n<span style=\"color:#18C118;\" class=\"wixui-rich-text__text\">&nbsp;Dreams come true</span></h4>"
    },
